member.summary:
An actor (a Person or a Group) row. The relational columns index the actor's identity;
the full ActivityStreams actor document (including the owner-only privateKey extension) is
carried in  (a jsonb column) and is the source of truth for content.

An EF Core (PostgreSQL)  over the shared Edges table (kind
). A reply edge is stored parent → child: parent is the
source (so "replies to this note" is the forward direction) and child is the target.
